title: Jellyfish
text: A PRISM splits white light into red, green and blue, and sends each colour off in its own direction. Turn it until the jellyfish trails all three tentacles.
trick: one prism fans white light into three primaries
motif: jellyfish: a diagonal body and three trailing tentacles
